<http://data.silknow.org/object/03d3f1b1-c3ae-36a1-a493-a09112e2c2ab>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Valance of embroidered canvas with coloured silk and wool, France, 1550-1599"@en , "Valance of embroidered canvas with coloured silk and wool in tent stitch. Divided into five square panels are the following subjects, from left to right: a Baroque vase containing roses, caduceus between two cornucopiae, classical vase with carnations, bunch of violas, roses and fruit bound by ribbon, caduceus with two cornucopiae. Each square has a dark blue background and a border of flowers, each with two leaves. The squares are separated and the valance is bordered by a band of vine ornament-trailing borders with leaves and bunches of grapes in green, brown and black on yellow silk."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/680b06cc-12d3-369d-bbbd-b5ce6dc5d950> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Valance of embroidered canvas with coloured silk and wool in tent stitch. Divided into five square panels are the following subjects, from left to right: a Baroque vase containing roses, caduceus between two cornucopiae, classical vase with carnations, bunch of violas, roses and fruit bound by ribbon, caduceus with two cornucopiae. Each square has a dark blue background and a border of flowers, each with two leaves. The squares are separated and the valance is bordered by a band of vine ornament-trailing borders with leaves and bunches of grapes in green, brown and black on yellow silk."@en , "Valance of embroidered canvas with coloured silk and wool, France, 1550-1599"@en ;
